{"version":1,"content":"<p>周三，美股新墨西哥州法院下令Meta支付250億美元罰款，該案是一起數據私隱訴訟，源於十多年前該公司捲入的劍橋分析醜聞。根據一份法院文件披露，這一處罰決定是在聖菲法院陪審團於9月裁定Meta存在誤導行為之後作出的。陪審團認定，Meta就其如何保護用户數據、收集用户數據，以及如何防止有害信息在其服務上泛濫等問題，誤導了新墨西哥州民眾。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583258.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:44.531486+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:55:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"4718014fb0cff6e499a1ebbb07a7613b1951a69e5067758626ad44ab3290116b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}